  "description": "## About UNBUILT\n\n**Ideas are everywhere. Builders make them real.**\n\nUNBUILT is a buildathon by DevX, in collaboration with OpenAI, designed for curious minds who want to move beyond ideas and start building. Whether you're a beginner or an experienced developer, this is your space to learn, experiment, and turn your ideas into something real.\n\nThrough hands-on sessions, expert mentorship, and opportunities to connect with fellow builders, UNBUILT brings together a community that learns by doing. Explore new tools, discover better ways to build, and get the guidance you need to take your ideas from concept to creation.\n\nYou don't need to have everything figured out. You just need to start.\n\n**Come curious. Leave with something built.**",
